WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.1 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Workforce planning

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Match the people you will need to the work your strategy requires, starting with what you carry yourself.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Estimate time, skills and start date for each role.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Weigh co-founders, contractors and volunteers, who are not free.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name who covers if a founder cannot work.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft a workforce plan for your first one to two years.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
